{"id":"norway-fjords-moto","title":"Norway's fjords by motorcycle","who":"Classic route · western Norway's scenic roads","when":"June to August (Trollstigen open May–October)","vehicle":"Motorcycle, 6–8 days","kind":"moto","color":"#1d4ed8","summary":"From Bergen north through the fjord country: Stegastein above the Aurlandsfjord, the Sognefjord ferries, Geiranger and the Eagle Road, the eleven hairpins of Trollstigen, and the bridges of the Atlantic Road hopping over the sea. Wet weather, tolls and many ferries; long light nights.","sources":[{"label":"UKGSer: trip report Norway, July 2025","url":"https://www.ukgser.com/community/threads/trip-report-norway-july-2025.491204/"},{"label":"Lonely Planet: road-tripping Norway's west coast","url":"https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/winding-through-the-wilds-road-tripping-norways-west-coast"}],"approximate":"Main stops; ferry crossings are part of the roads.","km":689,"bbox":[5.304,60.3944,7.7862,63.1258],"stops":[{"name":"Bergen","place":"Bergen, Norway","at":[60.3943,5.3259],"text":"The wooden wharf of Bryggen, and usually rain.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Bryggen%2C_Bergen%2C_Noruega%2C_2019-09-08%2C_DD_115-117_PAN.jpg/500px-Bryggen%2C_Bergen%2C_Noruega%2C_2019-09-08%2C_DD_115-117_PAN.jpg","page":"Bryggen","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bryggen%2C_Bergen%2C_Noruega%2C_2019-09-08%2C_DD_115-117_PAN.jpg","credit":"Diego Delso","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Flåm","place":"Flåm, Norway","at":[60.863,7.1132],"text":"The Stegastein viewpoint high over the Aurlandsfjord.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Stegastein_viewpoint_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg/500px-Stegastein_viewpoint_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg","page":"Stegastein","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stegastein_viewpoint_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg","credit":"TomasEE","license":"CC BY 3.0"}},{"name":"Sognefjord","place":"Sogndal, Norway","at":[61.32